{"about_the_game":"Wield the sonic screwdriver as you join the Thirteenth Doctor (voiced by Jodie Whittaker) on a quest to save the universe, and meet the Tenth Doctor along the way (voiced by David Tennant in a guest appearance).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/04824823d2b51db0eafab42f4a47d95f.poster.avif?t=1759147663\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/04824823d2b51db0eafab42f4a47d95f.webm?t=1759147663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/04824823d2b51db0eafab42f4a47d95f.mp4?t=1759147663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience an unforgettable story-driven adventure through space and time, face terrifying monsters and solve a mind-bending mystery!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/56e20d8705668e4283d29b736d129d0c.avif?t=1759147663\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br><br>Enter the Chaosverse, where reality itself is threatened by a series of time-breaking glitches, in this original Doctor Who story from Gavin Collinson, the writer of the critically-acclaimed game <i>Doctor Who: The Lonely Assassins</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/10e3b443ec12788ce689c2388474f72a.poster.avif?t=1759147663\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/10e3b443ec12788ce689c2388474f72a.webm?t=1759147663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/10e3b443ec12788ce689c2388474f72a.mp4?t=1759147663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/7862784b2ad54e12b3b294240ce15428.avif?t=1759147663\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br><br>Face classic Doctor Who monsters, including Daleks, Weeping Angels and Cybermen and confront a terrifying new threat: The CyberReaper. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/f708be99486b0b82b2226027f2730ece.poster.avif?t=1759147663\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/f708be99486b0b82b2226027f2730ece.webm?t=1759147663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/f708be99486b0b82b2226027f2730ece.mp4?t=1759147663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/3ff62dc5d041d5b239cb34bf0404e567.avif?t=1759147663\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br><br>Now for non-VR platforms, <i>Doctor Who: The Edge of Reality</i> features brand-new characters including the Tenth Doctor (voiced by David Tennant) and new locations to explore, with a reimagined and expanded story that builds on the previous game <i>The Edge of Time</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/789545ac5462beb158abc35b8bf1a1f0.poster.avif?t=1759147663\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/789545ac5462beb158abc35b8bf1a1f0.webm?t=1759147663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/789545ac5462beb158abc35b8bf1a1f0.mp4?t=1759147663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Will you answer the call?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1444920/18e2f5d207c09115ae7bcc8bd3625b934f71a180.jpg"},{"name":"It's just an empty cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1444920/7000db6cc19b0bdd359c9261347cc1e438861432.jpg"},{"name":"Hero of time!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1444920/77ee3d52dd630cae8e2e266c125ee13a55f8f13a.jpg"},{"name":"This disgraceful device","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1444920/6e13380117ef695bb2c18b9a4041a52033b333fd.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to the world of tomorrow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1444920/96d59502dba7158545d5a847454035a5e80621eb.jpg"},{"name":"Exterminate!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1444920/dc7c81d64ff547a017a57b69b44dfcadea1a553f.jpg"},{"name":"Bullseye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1444920/1504cff21b334ed042d59ae01098bd6dfc08f76a.jpg"},{"name":"This is getting to be a habit!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1444920/714488bb1519104cddc7af88907f640f388ea7be.jpg"},{"name":"Sherlock who?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1444920/1973c472aa06a6eaf0f37dbf66d07ebb8f4f7736.jpg"},{"name":"The Big Brain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1444920/d73af36f6e2f926e927a6eedcbc40e4680de6dcd.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1444920?t=1759147663","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759147663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759147663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759147663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Get Peaky Blinders: The King's Ransom Complete Edition</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Wield the sonic screwdriver as you join the Thirteenth Doctor (voiced by Jodie Whittaker) on a quest to save the universe, and meet the Tenth Doctor along the way (voiced by David Tennant in a guest appearance).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/04824823d2b51db0eafab42f4a47d95f.poster.avif?t=1759147663\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/04824823d2b51db0eafab42f4a47d95f.webm?t=1759147663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/04824823d2b51db0eafab42f4a47d95f.mp4?t=1759147663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience an unforgettable story-driven adventure through space and time, face terrifying monsters and solve a mind-bending mystery!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/56e20d8705668e4283d29b736d129d0c.avif?t=1759147663\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br><br>Enter the Chaosverse, where reality itself is threatened by a series of time-breaking glitches, in this original Doctor Who story from Gavin Collinson, the writer of the critically-acclaimed game <i>Doctor Who: The Lonely Assassins</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/10e3b443ec12788ce689c2388474f72a.poster.avif?t=1759147663\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/10e3b443ec12788ce689c2388474f72a.webm?t=1759147663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/10e3b443ec12788ce689c2388474f72a.mp4?t=1759147663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/7862784b2ad54e12b3b294240ce15428.avif?t=1759147663\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br><br>Face classic Doctor Who monsters, including Daleks, Weeping Angels and Cybermen and confront a terrifying new threat: The CyberReaper. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/f708be99486b0b82b2226027f2730ece.poster.avif?t=1759147663\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/f708be99486b0b82b2226027f2730ece.webm?t=1759147663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/f708be99486b0b82b2226027f2730ece.mp4?t=1759147663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444920/extras/3ff62dc5d041d5b239cb34